# Tetra visual identity

When designing or coding any Tetra surface, read `brand/GUIDE.md` and apply `.cursor/skills/tetra-brand` plus `.cursor/skills/tetra-vite-ui` (or `tetra-pdf` for print).

- Void `#050705`. Radius 0. Jost. Green `#22c55e` primary. Violet and orange are glows only.
- Mark is Tetrahedron G (`brand/geometry/tetrahedron-g.svg`).
- Default build is Vite. Import `brand/tokens.css` and `brand/chrome.css`.
- One top chrome element: full bar at rest, morphs to top-left triangle on scroll.
- Bottom-right dock triangle opens the sliding footer. Glass only on chrome.
